Article_Body:
Every contact named on a request gets the same e-mails:
• the invitation when Beiersdorf sends you a request;
• a new question from Beiersdorf, or one it returns because it needs more information;
• a question Beiersdorf changed or closed (no answer needed);
• one request for your final release when Beiersdorf has completed its review, and a note if that request is withdrawn because a review was reopened;
• a receipt after your final release;
• reminders before and after a due date;
• a note when Beiersdorf withdraws or reactivates a request.
Each e-mail links straight to the item in the portal. Beiersdorf's internal assessments are never sent to you.
